{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>韓國爆紅「年糕鬆餅」！</h2>\n<p>去韓國旅行，除了咖啡和蛋糕，也別錯過這款融合雙重口感的人氣甜點——「Tteokffle年糕鬆餅」。韓國知名連鎖咖啡廳「카페인중독」以獨門麵糊配方，將鬆餅的酥脆與韓式年糕的Q彈完美結合，一咬下去，外層香脆、內裡煙韌，令人一試難忘。\n</p>\n<h2>外脆內軟</h2>\n<p>「Tteokffle」最大賣點，在於外皮像鬆餅一樣酥脆，內裡卻保有韓式年糕般的Q彈嚼勁。這種「外脆內軟」的反差口感，正是它迅速爆紅的原因。品牌更在鬆餅中加入自家研發的動物性鮮奶油，令整體口感更滑順濃郁。傳統年糕的風味，以鬆餅形式重新演繹，既有熟悉感，又充滿新意。</p>\n<h2>三款口味任你揀</h2>\n<p>目前「Tteokffle」共推出三款人氣口味，包括卡士達蜂蜜蛋糕年糕鬆餅、南瓜年糕鬆餅，以及經典原味年糕鬆餅。卡士達蜂蜜蛋糕款以香甜卡士達與蜂蜜蛋糕風味為主，南瓜款則加入南瓜醬與鮮奶油，帶來濃郁秋日氣息；經典原味款則最適合喜歡純粹年糕香氣的人。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519042558758159_17126491956b006e9a2fdce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519042558758159_17126491956b006e9a2fdce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951904283092266_6222111286b006e9cb9a79.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951904283092266_6222111286b006e9cb9a79.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519043024598436_20148791556b006e9ec52c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519043024598436_20148791556b006e9ec52c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519043255860985_7782107866b006ea10d4ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519043255860985_7782107866b006ea10d4ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df90hrkk8gw/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.143217+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":501,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:00:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:50.702366+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:50.702366+00:00","content_hash":"b40d2dff9565952b4fa023c8237a696908074f498d85c3aed4284b1a0332d16e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}